Time complexity: `O(n)` average time.
Space complexity: `O(n)` for the set. The links of duplicate nodes are changed.

Instead of checking every node against the previous one, this version treats equal values as one run. For each node, it moves a second pointer over all following nodes with the same value, then connects the kept node to the first different value.

This makes the link update happen once per group. The head node is always kept, and the returned head is unchanged.

